Title: Test Script
Author: Claude
Draft date: January 6, 2026

===

INT. BEDROOM - DAY

JOHN, 30s, wakes up. He looks at his phone - 8:47 AM. He's late.

JOHN
(to himself)
Not again.

He jumps out of bed and rushes to the bathroom.

EXT. APARTMENT BUILDING - DAY

John runs out of the building, carrying his briefcase. A taxi passes by.

JOHN
Taxi!

The taxi doesn't stop. John sighs.

INT. COFFEE SHOP - MORNING

John enters, out of breath. MARY, the barista, smiles.

MARY
The usual?

JOHN
Please. And make it quick.

MARY
Rough morning?

JOHN
You have no idea.

Mary hands him a coffee. John pays and rushes out.

INT. OFFICE - DAY

John enters the office. His boss, MR. THOMPSON, stands by the door.

MR. THOMPSON
You're late. Again.

JOHN
I'm sorry, Mr. Thompson. It won't happen again.

MR. THOMPSON
It better not. We have a meeting in five minutes.

INT. CONFERENCE ROOM - DAY - CONTINUOUS

John sits down at the table. Other EMPLOYEES are already seated.

MR. THOMPSON
Let's begin.

The meeting starts. John takes a sip of his coffee.

EXT. OFFICE BUILDING - DAY

Wide shot of the office building against the city skyline.

INT. JOHN'S APARTMENT - NIGHT

John arrives home, exhausted. He puts his briefcase down and collapses on the couch.

JOHN
(to himself)
Tomorrow will be different.

He closes his eyes.

FADE OUT.
